{
 "about": "Osc A of the init patch of the Audio Unit playing tables of ours (frame j (-1)^j · a sine: the sign of the output tells the frame, between two frames it is (1 - 2m) · the sine, m the share of the new one) while A WT Pos is automated (set every 16 samples; the AU glides it, its fades start some ms after a step): `lengths` a step from frame 0 to 1 by rate and note: the sample the fade starts at and its length in samples (the line of m through 0.15..0.85); `sweeps` 256 frames swept from 0.3 s over 4, 1 and 0.25 s at 220 Hz: each change of sign [start, samples, sign before, sign after]; `unison` A Unison 2 (one voice right, one left): `detuned` at Detune 1 (±200 cents) each channel its period and its fade, `spread` Detune 0 and A Uni WT Pos 0.75: the right voice crosses at 0.5 s, the left one at 0.7 s; `bends` a pitch bend of 12 semitones up and down over 0.49..0.53 s while the right voice fades (m against the left one, on frame 0): the fade, the most a sample of it is off its line (`off`) and the periods of the left voice at its start and its end; scripts/renders/run.mjs --only=frame-fades",
